# Fixture for test_cif_reader_symmetry.cpp: H-M 'I m -3 m' with an
# incomplete operator loop (the identity, the I-centring translation and
# the threefold y,z,x without its square z,x,y), and Fe1 on a general
# position (0.08,0.20,0.32), whose 96 images in I m -3 m are all more than
# 0.4 A apart (gemmi merges images closer than that). The loop names no
# group, so gemmi falls back to the H-M symbol: 96 atoms, and the record is
# inconsistent (a WARNING).
